@startuml
title Proposed System Context — Draft, not verified as-built
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Learner
actor HR
actor "Authorized Researcher/Admin" as Admin

rectangle "RubroRAG Training & Assessment Platform" {
  component "Web Application\n(UI + Application Rules)" as Web
  component "Application Database\n(Transactional State)" as DB
  component "RubroRAG AI Service\n(Existing pipeline adapter)" as AI
  database "Vector Store / Knowledge Index\n(if retained after audit)" as Vector
}

Learner --> Web : Complete assessment\nView released results
HR --> Web : Manage assessments\nReview and release
Admin --> Web : Authorized maintenance
Web --> DB : Persist assignments,\nsubmissions and decisions
Web --> AI : Validated AI request
AI --> Vector : Retrieve approved evidence
AI --> Web : Structured output + metadata

note bottom
DRAFT: Validate actors, ownership, store and API boundary
against approved thesis scope and actual source code.
Do not interpret this as the implementation diagram.
end note
@enduml
